{"id":"sbd_kernel","title":"Exponential transform of SBD","family":"kernel","definition":"reference","intro_en":"SBD selects the largest normalized cross-correlation over global shifts, then subtracts it from one. This atlas construction maps that SBD value through exp(-2*SBD). The lag sweep makes its shift tolerance visible, while its full-series normalization distinguishes it from overlap-normalized Pearson correlation.","intro_zh":"SBD 在全局平移中选择最大的归一化互相关，再用一减去该值。本图谱构造进一步计算 exp(-2*SBD)。动图逐个扫描滞后，展示平移容忍性；采用完整序列能量归一化，与重叠区域 Pearson 相关不同。","steps_en":["Z-normalize both series using their own full-series mean and standard deviation.","Evaluate zero-padded cross-correlation at every global lag.","Set SBD to one minus the largest full-energy-normalized correlation.","Apply exp(-2*SBD) to obtain the stated kernel-like score."],"steps_zh":["用各自完整序列的均值和标准差进行 z 标准化。","在每个全局滞后处计算零填充互相关。","令 SBD 等于一减完整能量归一化相关的最大值。","应用 exp(-2*SBD)，得到明确约定的核形式分数。"],"formula":"K=exp(-2*(1-max_lag NCC_lag(z(x),z(y))))","caveats_en":["Maximizing over shifts and exponentiating a distance-like score do not establish positive semidefiniteness.","Only one global lag is chosen. Constant inputs have undefined statistical normalization and need an explicit software convention."],"caveats_zh":["对平移取最大值再指数化距离形式分数，不能证明半正定性。","只选择一个全局滞后；常数输入的统计归一化未定义，需要明确的软件约定。"],"sources":[{"label":"EchoTime low-level similarity implementations","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/similarity_methods.py"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"gamma":2.0,"normalize":true,"NCC_normalization":"full-series L2 energies","best_lag":-1,"sbd":0.09702301325884444},"result":{"label":"kernel 